    "Change the passcode?": "Tukar kod laluan?",
    "Are you sure? There is no way to undo this — the saved passcode is replaced only when you save a new one.": "Anda pasti? Tiada cara untuk membatalkannya — kod laluan yang disimpan hanya diganti apabila anda menyimpan yang baharu.",
    "The friend who set the Screen Time passcode can store it here so it isn't lost. Going back without saving keeps the current one.": "Rakan yang menetapkan kod laluan Masa Skrin boleh menyimpannya di sini supaya tidak hilang. Kembali tanpa menyimpan mengekalkan yang semasa.",
    "Viewing the stored passcode is behind your less-strict delay: request it, wait out the delay, and you get one look. After that it locks again.": "Melihat kod laluan yang disimpan berada di sebalik penantian anda yang kurang ketat: minta, tunggu penantian, dan anda mendapat satu pandangan. Selepas itu ia dikunci semula.",
    "Access is spent — viewing it again needs a new request.": "Akses telah digunakan — melihatnya semula memerlukan permintaan baharu.",
