    "Take photo": "Ambil foto",
    "Takes about 2 minutes, and you need a second person physically with you.": "Mengambil masa kira-kira 2 minit, dan anda memerlukan orang kedua yang hadir bersama anda.",
    "Tap “Lock Screen Time Settings” (or “Use Screen Time Passcode”).": "Ketik 'Kunci Tetapan Masa Skrin' (atau 'Guna Kod Laluan Masa Skrin').",
    "Thank you. ❤️": "Terima kasih. ❤️",
    "That's okay. Without Screen Time access Demora can't block apps, but you can continue and turn it on later.": "Tidak mengapa. Tanpa akses Masa Skrin Demora tidak boleh menyekat apl, tetapi anda boleh teruskan dan menghidupkannya kemudian.",
    "That's the whole loop. Your real limits, schedules, and settings are still here — nothing changed.": "Itulah keseluruhan gelung. Had, jadual dan tetapan sebenar anda masih di sini — tiada apa yang berubah.",
    "There's a way to make Demora impossible to turn off — with a friend's help. It takes about 2 minutes and needs a second person physically with you.": "Ada cara untuk menjadikan Demora mustahil dimatikan — dengan bantuan rakan. Ia mengambil masa kira-kira 2 minit dan memerlukan orang kedua yang hadir bersama anda.",
    "They call themselves “%@”.": "Mereka memanggil diri mereka “%@”.",
    "This guide is behind your less-strict delay: request it, wait out the delay, and you get one open. After you view it, it locks again.": "Panduan ini berada di sebalik penantian anda yang kurang ketat: minta, tunggu penantian, dan ia dibuka sekali. Selepas anda melihatnya, ia dikunci semula.",
    "Unavailable": "Tidak tersedia",
    "Unlock the “Prevent disabling” guide": "Buka kunci panduan 'Halang pelumpuhan'",
    "Use photo": "Guna foto",
    "When asked for Screen Time Passcode Recovery, your friend signs in with THEIR OWN Apple ID — not yours. That's what stops you from resetting the passcode on your own.": "Apabila diminta Pemulihan Kod Laluan Masa Skrin, rakan anda log masuk dengan Apple ID MEREKA SENDIRI — bukan milik anda. Itulah yang menghalang anda menetapkan semula kod laluan sendiri.",
    "You can always find this later under Help — but there it's behind a delay.": "Anda sentiasa boleh menemuinya kemudian di Bantuan — tetapi di sana ia berada di sebalik penantian.",
    "You can change these any time under General blocking. Each change then goes through your delays.": "Anda boleh menukarnya bila-bila masa di Penyekatan am. Setiap perubahan kemudian melalui penantian anda.",
